{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104381","id":2405073129,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6PWoDp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104381/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104381/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8a76e315473228300922b957375a79e8cb157fcb","number":104381,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize `Object::notification` by avoiding runtime branches","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Follow-up of / supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94239.\r\n\r\nBenchmarks suggests this change improves `Object::notification` performance by 17% / 12% over https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94239.\r\n\r\n`Object::notification` is called quite a lot, so it needs to be _really_ fast. The idea for improvement is the same as what @CrazyRoka suggested doing in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94239: Reduce runtime branching by branching statically instead, Normally, a simple `bool` check doesn't make a difference, but because it's called so often, it does make a difference here.\r\n\r\nTherefore, forward and reverse notifications are split into two separate virtual functions. They're still automatically generated (as before) for convenience, but the branch this creates should be optimized out by the compiler (because it's statically evaluatable).\r\n\r\n## Practical Test\r\nI tested with the MRP from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94239.\r\n\r\nI tested `master`, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94239 (rebased onto master) and this PR against one another by launching 3 instances of the same scene with 10k cubes.\r\nThe performance impact was rather small, but measurable:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1180\" alt=\"SCR-20250319-tghj\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae5d6d2f-d375-4a12-baf7-fe1c1f103196\" />\r\n\r\nThe fps fluctuated somewhat, so the screenshot is a bit of a lie, but I'm pretty sure it pretty consistently ranks as `master`, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94239, `this PR` in order of increasing fps.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\nMy benchmark suggests a 17% improvement over `master`, and a 12% improvement over #94239.\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\tNode3D *node = memnew(Node3D);\r\n\r\n\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < 500000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\tnode->notification(Node::NOTIFICATION_VP_MOUSE_ENTER);\r\n\t}\r\n\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis yielded:\r\n- `2415ms` on this pr \r\n- `2727ms` on #94239\r\n- `2891ms` on master\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sa